{
  "videoId": "C003",
  "title": "为什么工资总涨不过物价",
  "scenes": [
    {
      "sceneId": "S01",
      "narrationSegment": "你有没有发现，工资明明在涨，钱却越来越不经花？十年前一百块能买一周菜，现在进超市一转眼就没了。",
      "background": "小镇街道",
      "subtitle": {
        "highlights": ["工资", "一百块"]
      },
      "elements": [
        {
          "type": "character",
          "name": "小明",
          "emotion": "thinking",
          "enterFrom": "left",
          "zIndex": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "prop",
          "name": "钱袋",
          "enterFrom": "right",
          "zIndex": 3
        }
      ],
      "preferredStart": 0.0
    },
    {
      "sceneId": "S02",
      "narrationSegment": "其实这不是错觉。工资涨的是数字，物价涨的是生活成本。物价跑得比工资快，你的购买力就在偷偷缩水。",
      "background": "超市内部",
      "subtitle": {
        "highlights": ["物价", "购买力"]
      },
      "elements": [
        {
          "type": "character",
          "name": "小明",
          "emotion": "explaining",
          "enterFrom": "none",
          "zIndex": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "prop",
          "name": "物价牌",
          "enterFrom": "left",
          "zIndex": 3
        }
      ],
      "preferredStart": 10.82
    },
    {
      "sceneId": "S03",
      "narrationSegment": "为什么会这样？因为物价是被大家一起抬上去的：原材料涨、人工贵、房租高，每一环成本都悄悄加进商品价格里，买单的还是你。",
      "background": "超市内部",
      "subtitle": {
        "highlights": ["成本", "商品价格"]
      },
      "elements": [
        {
          "type": "character",
          "name": "小明",
          "emotion": "serious",
          "enterFrom": "none",
          "zIndex": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "prop",
          "name": "超市货架",
          "enterFrom": "right",
          "zIndex": 3
        }
      ],
      "preferredStart": 20.75
    },
    {
      "sceneId": "S04",
      "narrationSegment": "更要命的是，工资总是慢半拍。企业要等行情稳了才舍得加薪。等你拿到加薪通知，物价早就又涨了一轮。",
      "background": "小镇街道",
      "subtitle": {
        "highlights": ["加薪", "慢半拍"]
      },
      "elements": [
        {
          "type": "character",
          "name": "小明",
          "emotion": "worried",
          "enterFrom": "none",
          "zIndex": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "prop",
          "name": "工资条",
          "enterFrom": "left",
          "zIndex": 3
        }
      ],
      "preferredStart": 32.9
    },
    {
      "sceneId": "S05",
      "narrationSegment": "所以记住，看工资别只看数字，要看它买得到什么。与其干等加薪，不如先学会让钱生钱，这才是对抗物价的长期办法。",
      "background": "小镇街道",
      "subtitle": {
        "highlights": ["让钱生钱", "长期办法"]
      },
      "elements": [
        {
          "type": "character",
          "name": "小明",
          "emotion": "explaining",
          "enterFrom": "none",
          "zIndex": 2
        },
        {
